      "writtenOn": "2026-07-31T05:40:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "d2marp/Dockerfile only pins MARP_VERSION/D2_VERSION; firefox-esr, npm, and golang are installed unpinned from apt, and the base image is debian:trixie-slim (a moving tag, not a digest). Since Marp\u0027s PDF export depends on the bundled browser, an unpinned browser is exactly the kind of thing likely to silently break reproducibility later. Consider pinning at least the browser package.",
